WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.100 --> 00:00:02.625
If else chooses between two things.

2
00:00:03.553 --> 00:00:08.203
If the question is true, the first part runs. Otherwise, the second.

3
00:00:09.057 --> 00:00:13.607
else if adds more questions. The micro:bit asks them from the top.

4
00:00:16.107 --> 00:00:20.507
The first true one runs, and the rest are skipped. So order matters.
